market]] [[shouted|shout]] [[for]] [[more]]. Linh [[was|be]] [[amazed]]. [[Was|be]] [[all]] [[that]] [[noise]] [[really]] [[for]] [[her]]? Khoa [[smiled|smile]] [[at]] [[her]] [[over]] [[his]] [[guitar]]. [[She]] [[had|have]] [[never]] [[seen|see]] [[him]] [[so]] [[happy]].`,`vn`:`Khi b\u00e0i h\u00e1t k\u1ebft th\u00fac, kh\u00f4ng ai nh\u00fac nh\u00edch. R\u1ed3i c\u1ea3 khu ch\u1ee3 \u0111\u1ed3ng thanh \u0111\u00f2i h\u00e1t th\u00eam. Linh s\u1eefng s\u1edd. Ch\u1eebng \u1ea5y ti\u1ebfng reo h\u00f2 l\u00e0 d\u00e0nh cho c\u00f4 th\u1eadt sao? Khoa m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1edbi c\u00f4 qua c\u00e2y \u0111\u00e0n. C\u00f4 ch\u01b0a bao gi\u1edd th\u1ea5y c\u1eadu vui \u0111\u1ebfn th\u1ebf.`},{`en`:`[[During]] [[a]] [[romantic]] [[song]], an [[old]] [[couple]] [[near]] [[the]] [[front]] [[danced|dance]] [[slowly]], [[holding|hold]] [[hands|hand]]. [[The]] [[music]] [[attracted|attract]] [[more]] [[and]] [[more]] [[people]], [[and]] [[soon]] [[the]] [[band]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[biggest|big]] [[attraction]] [[of]] [[the]] [[night]]. Linh [[felt|feel]] [[the]] [[spirit]] [[of]] [[the]] [[market]] [[all]] [[around]] [[her]], [[warm]], [[noisy]] [[and]] [[alive]]. [[She]] [[had|have]] [[never]] [[known|know]] [[such]] [[happiness]].`,`vn`:`Khi m\u1ed9t b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea1c l\u00e3ng m\u1ea1n vang l\u00ean, m\u1ed9t \u0111\u00f4i v\u1ee3 ch\u1ed3ng gi\u00e0 \u0111\u1ee9ng g\u1ea7n ph\u00eda tr\u01b0\u1edbc n\u1eafm tay nhau nh\u1ea3y ch\u1ea7m ch\u1eadm. Ti\u1ebfng nh\u1ea1c thu h\u00fat ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi, v\u00e0 ch\u1eb3ng m\u1ea5y ch\u1ed1c ban nh\u1ea1c \u0111\u00e3 th\u00e0nh \u0111i\u1ec3m h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 \u0111\u00eam ch\u1ee3. Linh c\u1ea3m nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1i h\u1ed3n c\u1ee7a khu ch\u1ee3 \u0111ang bao quanh m\u00ecnh, \u1ea5m \u00e1p, \u1ed3n \u00e3 v\u00e0 tr\u00e0n \u0111\u1ea7y s\u1ee9c s\u1ed1ng. C\u00f4 ch\u01b0a t\u1eebng bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn ni\u1ec1m h\u1ea1nh ph\u0